<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261006231000 +0000" stop="20261007001000 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">Sur les traces andalouses, une architecture millénaire</title>
    <desc lang="fr">Andalusia, the Spanish territory has a confluence of cultures which is represented in its architecture! Visigothic, Roman, Byzantine and Arab - the structures in the region display all these influences. Between 8th &amp; 15th century, several dynasties from Arab to Berber conquered Andalusia impacting the way of life of people. The film tells this story through beautiful edifices of Andalusia.</desc>
    <category lang="fr">Documentaire</category>
    <icon src="http://static-cdn.tv.sfr.net/data/img/pl/6/0/4/15647406.jpg" />
  </programme>
  
